<title>USA: CCC to seek 19,860 T wheat for Ethiopia, Pakistan.</title>
<headline>CCC to seek 19,860 T wheat for Ethiopia, Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of USDA said it will to tender September 10 for 19,860 tonnes of soft white wheat of which 15,340 is for donation to Ethiopia and 4,520 for Pakistan.</p>
<p>Shipment is to be Sept 25-Oct 20.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
